        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回答僅使用裝置上的分析——計數、搜尋和列表仍可使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answers use on-device analysis until the model reports it is ready." : {
